{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"6b795381ef88107e","name":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/OceaniaStorm/units/card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"75th RIFLE REGIMENT","text":"Add a copy next to your HQ when targeted by an enemy effect.","flavorText":"The 75th Rifle Regiment served as part of the Soviet 31st Rifle Division, alongside the 177th and 248th Rifle Regiments. Formed near Stalingrad in 1925, the division spent the interwar years in the region before moving to the Caucasus in 1940 to strengthen the Iranian and Turkish borders. During WWII, the 31st Rifle Division fought at Rostov and later retreated into the Caucasus during Case Blue, suffering heavy losses in the defense of Tuapse. It returned to the offensive as German forces withdrew and later fought in the Battle of the Dnieper, the Second Jassy–Kishinev Offensive and the Vistula–Oder Offensive. In 1945, the division took part in both the Berlin and Prague offensives, ending the war deep in Central Europe.","faction":"Soviet","type":"infantry","rarity":"Unique","cost":6,"operationCost":2,"attack":6,"defense":7},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment_title","SourceString":"75th RIFLE REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"75th RIFLE REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":6,"defense":7,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":6,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment_text","SourceString":"Add a copy next to your HQ when targeted by an enemy effect.","LocalizedString":"Add a copy next to your HQ when targeted by an enemy effect."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 75th Rifle Regiment served as part of the Soviet 31st Rifle Division, alongside the 177th and 248th Rifle Regiments. Formed near Stalingrad in 1925, the division spent the interwar years in the region before moving to the Caucasus in 1940 to strengthen the Iranian and Turkish borders. During WWII, the 31st Rifle Division fought at Rostov and later retreated into the Caucasus during Case Blue, suffering heavy losses in the defense of Tuapse. It returned to the offensive as German forces withdrew and later fought in the Battle of the Dnieper, the Second Jassy–Kishinev Offensive and the Vistula–Oder Offensive. In 1945, the division took part in both the Berlin and Prague offensives, ending the war deep in Central Europe.","LocalizedString":"The 75th Rifle Regiment served as part of the Soviet 31st Rifle Division, alongside the 177th and 248th Rifle Regiments. Formed near Stalingrad in 1925, the division spent the interwar years in the region before moving to the Caucasus in 1940 to strengthen the Iranian and Turkish borders. During WWII, the 31st Rifle Division fought at Rostov and later retreated into the Caucasus during Case Blue, suffering heavy losses in the defense of Tuapse. It returned to the offensive as German forces withdrew and later fought in the Battle of the Dnieper, the Second Jassy–Kishinev Offensive and the Vistula–Oder Offensive. In 1945, the division took part in both the Berlin and Prague offensives, ending the war deep in Central Europe."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::OceaniaStorm","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnBeforeOtherCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnBeforeOtherCardDeploymentTrigger"],"hasGuard":true,"historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/75th_RIFLE_REGIMENT.75th_RIFLE_REGIMENT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_75th_rifle_regiment_photo","SourceString":"Red Army infantry during street fighting in Rostov, Eastern Front, 1942.","LocalizedString":"Red Army infantry during st